segment develops commercial properties; and invests in real estate. It also engages in the home and lifestyle exhibition, including rental of booth and storage; and provision of shared services. The company was formerly known as Star Publications (Malaysia) Berhad and changed its name to Star Media Group Berhad in May 2015. Star Media Group Berhad was incorporated in 1971 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"Star Media Group Berhad 成立于1971年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也，前身为 Star Publications (Malaysia) Berhad，于2015年5月更名为现名。公司在马来西亚、美国、英国、新加坡及国际范围内从事报纸、杂志及数字内容的出版、印刷与发行，并通过印刷、数字与活动；广播；房地产开发与投资三个分部运营。","lines":["印刷、数字与活动：出版、印刷和发行报纸与杂志，在印刷及电子媒体和在线门户上提供广告，并提供活动组织管理服务。","广播：运营无线广播电台。","房地产开发与投资：开发商业地产并投资房地产。","家居与生活方式展览：举办展览，包括展位和仓储租赁，并提供共享服务。"],"lines_en":["Print, Digital and Events: Publication, printing and distribution of newspapers and magazines; advertising in print and electronic media and online portal; and event organizing management.","Broadcasting: Operates wireless radio broadcasting stations.","Property Development and Investment: Develops commercial properties and invests in real estate.","Home and Lifestyle Exhibition: Organizes exhibitions, including booth and storage rental, and provides shared services."]}}